License: GPL-3.0-or-later
Description: Zero-extra-package transaction safety and rollback wrapper for Entware opkg.
 Provides simulation-first package changes, bounded package-file snapshots, automatic rollback,
 health checks, transaction history, recovery, verification, and package-set lock auditing.
